---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Refund & Return Policy" description="Kidtoy Factory B2B refund and return policy - quality guarantee, inspection period, and wholesale order terms.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-navy mb-6">Refund & Return Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose max-w-none text-gray-500 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">Quality Guarantee</h2>
      <p>All products undergo strict quality inspection before shipment. We guarantee that goods match the approved samples and specifications.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">Inspection Period</h2>
      <p>Buyers have 7 calendar days from receipt to inspect goods. Any quality discrepancies must be reported within this period with photographic evidence.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">Returns</h2>
      <p>Returns are accepted only for manufacturing defects or incorrect shipments. As a B2B wholesale supplier, we do not accept returns for reasons other than quality issues.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">Refunds</h2>
      <p>Approved refunds are processed within 14 business days. Refunds cover the product cost only; shipping costs are non-refundable unless the error was on our part.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
